{"name":"Cordial","hex":"#864c52","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"cordial","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Hearty; sincere; warm; affectionate.","Radiating warmth and friendliness; genial."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A concentrated non-carbonated soft drink which is diluted with water before drinking.","An individual serving of such a diluted drink."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/cordial"}],"entries":[{"title":"Liqueur","blocks":[{"text":"A liqueur or cordial is an alcoholic drink composed of spirits and additional flavorings such as sugar, fruits, herbs, and spices. Often served with or after dessert, they are typically heavily sweetened and un-aged, beyond a resting period during production, when necessary, for their flavors to mingle."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/92/Licor-Beir%C3%A3o-%26-Orus_-_Orus_Clothing_%28cropped%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Liqueur","wikidata":"Q178780"},{"title":"Cordial (candy)","blocks":[{"text":"A cordial is a type of confection in which liquid filling is placed within a chocolate shell. A well known confectionery of this type is the cherry cordial."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d9/Cherry_cordial_%28candy%29.JPG/330px-Cherry_cordial_%28candy%29.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cordial_(candy)","wikidata":"Q5169969"},{"title":"Cordial (medicine)","blocks":[{"text":"A cordial is any invigorating and stimulating preparation that is intended for a medicinal purpose. The term derives from an obsolete usage. Various concoctions were formerly created that were believed to be beneficial to one's health, especially for the heart."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/68/Apothecarybottles.jpg/330px-Apothecarybottles.